# 24 -- seed-relative search boxes: OPTIM ... AUTO.
#
# Example 03 (NLOPT:LN_SBPLX, STEP 0.1) with the SGRIDMB box derived from
# the seed instead of written out. OPTIM SGRIDMB (1) AUTO sizes the box
# around the value in ../common/config.tadah (SGRIDMB 0.2). SGRIDMB is
# positive-only, so the default rule is RATIO 2: the geometric box
# [0.2/2, 0.2*2] = [0.1, 0.4], 03's explicit box. hpo_optim_resolved.hpo
# gets the resolved boxes as a paste-ready explicit OPTIM block, and
# hpo_search_space.tsv names the rule in its origin column (AUTO RATIO).
# The same box gives the same run: loss.tadah, params.tadah and the
# reference fingerprint are 03's.
#
# RCUT* keys cannot be AUTO (the neighbour list is sized from an explicit
# upper bound), so RCUT2B keeps its 4.0 6.0 box. STEP 0.1 is 10% of each
# box width, as in 03.

OPTIMIZER
  STRATEGY
    TYPE PLAIN
    LIB NLOPT
    ALGO LN_SBPLX
    MAXEVAL 60
    STEP 0.1
  ENDSTRATEGY
ENDOPTIMIZER

LOSS L2
FAILSCORE 1e16
PC_ERMSE 0 0.0001
PC_LAMMPS --script ../common/lammps/Ecoh.in --hotvar hot_a0 2.5 4.5 3.302 --varloss Ecoh 8.10 800

OPTIM RCUT2B  (1) 4.0 6.0
OPTIM SGRIDMB (1) AUTO

OUTPUT 1
BOUTPUT 1
